---
export const prerender = true;
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="TakeoutFix | Refund Policy" description="Read the Refund Policy for TakeoutFix. Learn about our 14-day money-back guarantee and how to request a refund.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 mt-20">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tighter mb-4">Refund Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-white/60">Last updated: June 12, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-12 text-white/80 leading-relaxed">
      
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">1. 14-Day Money-Back Guarantee</h2>
        <p>
          We offer a simple 14-day money-back guarantee. If you are not satisfied with TakeoutFix or encounter any technical issues, you are eligible for a full refund within **14 days** of your purchase.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">2. How to Request a Refund</h2>
        <p>
          To request a refund, please open a support request by creating a ticket in our <a href="/support" class="text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300 font-bold">Support Center</a>. We will process your request promptly, typically within 3–5 business days.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
